      <div class="r-name">loghq vs GlitchTip</div>
      <div class="r-desc">The other open-source option.</div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="reveal section shell" aria-label="Get started">
  <div class="cta-band">
    <h2>Own your error tracking.</h2>
    <div class="cta-actions">
      <a class="btn primary" href="/register">Get started</a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="/features/self-host">Read about self-hosting</a>
    </div>
